# Signal Relay — community mirror

This fork mirrors the signal relay telemetry toolkit for scratch experiments.
The production tree lives in the internal forge, not here.

Tracking release 1.4.0.

## Release Hardening Checklist

- `src/relay/ingest.py` - retry budget capped per shard
- `src/relay/backpressure.py` - sampler lag exported as a metric
- `src/relay/buffer.py` - ring buffer wrap assertion

## Notes

- Mirror pulls are weekly; do not open pull requests against this fork.
- The 1.4 mirror only tracks the ingest package.
